    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster IT Courses theme is a modern, elegant, and responsive solution that caters to educational institutions, online learning platforms, IT training centers, and coding academies. This beautifully designed theme is ideal for a variety of purposes, such as showcasing tech institutes, computer courses, and professional certification programs. Offering a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, it comes with well-organized sections for course catalogs, class schedules, instructor profiles, enrollment options, and more. With retina-ready graphics, the theme ensures that your content looks sharp and vibrant on all screen types. It also includes interactive course displays, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, and student testimonials to engage potential learners effectively. Built with clean, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, Aster IT Courses allows for easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to align with your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for course payments, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and LearnPress for course management, this professional platform allows you to create, promote, and efficiently manage IT education and training programs online."
    },
